<title>MALTA: SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT MALTA 6-0 IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT MALTA 6-0 IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Malta 6-0</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>6 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Szilard Nemeth 27, 29, 31, Robert Formanko 51,</p>
<p>Milan Jambor 58, 73.</p>
<p>    Standings	   P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Spain		    5   4   1   0   8   2  13</p>
<p> Slovakia		 3   2   1   0  10   1   7</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	     3   2   0   1   4   1   6</p>
<p> Czech Rebublic	 3   1   0   2   5   5   3</p>
<p> Malta		    6   0   0   6   0  18   0</p>
<p>Next match: Czech Republic v Yugoslavia, April 1.</p>
</text>
